{"body": "This adds a \"summary\" field to each snapshot stored in the metadata file.\nThe purpose of this extra information is to speed up operations by ignoring some snapshots. For example, when finding data to process incrementally, snapshots produced by a delete or replace operation can be ignored because no new data is added.\nThe summary is stored in the metadata file's list of snapshot objects as \"summary\". Each summary is an object with at least one key, \"operation\" that describes the operation that produced the snapshot. Possible values are \"append\", \"replace\", \"overwrite\" and \"delete\". These are defined in DataOperations.", "date": "2019-01-11T19:41:29Z", "hash": "sha256:a7c7200d71024653bb4b", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#74", "meta": {"additions": 441, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-03-06T00:43:40Z", "comments": 9, "deletions": 27, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/DataOperations.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/Snapshot.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/BaseSnapshot.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/FastAppend.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/MergeAppend.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/MergingSnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/OverwriteData.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/ReplaceFiles.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/ReplacePartitionsOperation.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/SnapshotParser.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/SnapshotSummary.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/SnapshotUpdate.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/StreamingDelete.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TestSnapshotJson.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TestTableMetadataJson.java", "core/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/avro/AvroTestHelpers.java"], "merged_at": "2019-03-06T00:43:40Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 16, "number": 74, "repo":