{"body": "Iceberg's current implementation has column case sensitivity, which hinders usability, as most sql users expect case insensitivity by default. While a query like the following will succeed in other Spark Readers, it will fail on Iceberg:\nSELECT COUNT(*)\nFROM iceTable\nWHERE year = 2017\n  AND MONTH = 11 -- Notice how MONTH has different casing than other predicates\n  AND day = 01\nThis will fail with a stack trace similar to:\ncom.google.common.util.concurrent.UncheckedExecutionException: com.netflix.iceberg.exceptions.ValidationException: Cannot find field 'MONTH' in struct: struct<...>\n...\n\nIn this PR, we solve this by making iceberg-api case-insensitive when binding expressions.\nSome further notes:\n\nWe could also solve this in iceberg-spark, however, that implies we would have to solve it in any other engine that supports iceberg ( presto, pig, etc ).\n\nEnabling case insensitivity implies that a table can not have columns were LOWER(a) == LOWER(b). I have a TODO in the PR as maybe this change makes more sense under a feature flag.", "date": "2019-01-17T23:14:08Z", "hash": "sha256:59ed55ddc65aacd7bf3e", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#82", "meta": {"additions": 114, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-01-23T19:19:17Z", "comments": 8, "deletions": 28, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/Binder.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/Evaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/InclusiveManifestEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/InclusiveMetricsEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/Projections.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/ResidualEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/StrictMetricsEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/UnboundPredicate.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/types/Types.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/TestExpressionBinding.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/TestPredicateBinding.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/transforms/TestProjection.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/BaseTableScan.java", "parquet/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/parquet/ParquetDictionaryRowGroupFilter.java", "parquet/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/parquet/ParquetFilters.java", "parquet/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/parquet/ParquetMetricsRowGroupFilter.java", "spark/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/spark/SparkExpressions.java", "spark/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/spark/SparkSchemaUtil.java"], "merged_at": "2019-01-23T19:19:17Z", "merged_by": "rdblue", "n_files": 18, "number": 82, "repo": "apache/iceberg", "reviews": [{"at": "2019-01-23T00:25:12Z", "by": "rdblue", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2019-01-23T18:21:46Z", "by": "xabriel", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "merged", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2019-01-23T19:20:01Z"}, "people": ["xabriel"], "refs": [], "source": "github", "title": "Make expression binding support a case sensitivity flag", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg/pull/82"}
