{"body": "In this PR we continue the work discussed in (#82), (#83), extending it to:\n\nAdding iceberg.case.sensitive flag to ConfigProperties.\nMake all Evaluators used in Iceberg read path honor this flag.\nExpose this flag for Spark Reader use in com.netflix.iceberg.spark.source.Reader\n\nI acknowledge this is a big PR, but the caseSensitive flag had to be trickled down as needed. I'm happy to break this into multiple PRs if committers think changes (0),(1),(2) should be separate, but do note the bulk of work is (1).", "date": "2019-01-30T02:29:25Z", "hash": "sha256:c77568a79999df7bfda0", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg#89", "meta": {"additions": 736, "base": "master", "closed_at": "2019-03-19T00:46:40Z", "comments": 34, "deletions": 73, "draft": false, "files": ["api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/Schema.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/TableScan.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/Evaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/InclusiveManifestEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/InclusiveMetricsEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/Projections.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/ResidualEvaluator.java", "api/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/types/TypeUtil.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/TestEvaluatior.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/TestInclusiveManifestEvaluator.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/expressions/TestInclusiveMetricsEvaluator.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/transforms/TestProjection.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/transforms/TestResiduals.java", "api/src/test/java/com/netflix/iceberg/types/TestReadabilityChecks.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/BaseTableScan.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/FilteredManifest.java", "core/src/main/java/com/netflix/iceberg/ManifestReader.java", "core/src/test/java/co